<section class="content-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">Legal &amp; Compliance Framework for Company Name Change</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Section 13:</strong> Alteration of MOA &ndash; name clause change requires Special Resolution + ROC approval</li>
                    <li><strong>Section 14:</strong> Alteration of AOA &ndash; consequential changes to reflect new name</li>
                    <li><strong>Section 4(3):</strong> Restrictions on company names &ndash; no government affiliation, no restricted words</li>
                    <li><strong>Section 12(3):</strong> Display name on signboard + old and new name on documents for 2 years</li>
                    <li><strong>Section 16:</strong> ROC power to direct name change if it conflicts with existing company/trademark</li>
                    <li><strong>Section 101:</strong> EGM notice &ndash; 21 clear days (shorter with 95% consent)</li>
                    <li><strong>Rule 29(1):</strong> Companies in default cannot change name</li>
                    <li><strong>RUN:</strong> Reserve Unique Name &ndash; Rs 1,000, valid 60 days</li>
                    <li><strong>Form MGT-14:</strong> Resolution filing within 30 days</li>
                    <li><strong>Form INC-24:</strong> Name change application to ROC</li>
                    <li><strong>Form INC-25:</strong> Fresh Certificate of Incorporation with new name</li>
                    <li><strong>ROC Mumbai:</strong> Everest House, 100 Marine Lines, Mumbai 400020</li>
                </ul>
                <p><strong>Filing Portal:</strong> <a href="https://www.mca.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">mca.gov.in</a> (MCA V3 portal)</p>

